    "body": "Update current state with the completed eight-row CUDA credit comparison, saved 512-case source-swap audit, and artifact-bound selected-source independence of the quarter bridge. The next step locates source-state, transport and consumption distinctions before a matched learning intervention.\n\nExact-head wording and diff checks pass; independent adversarial evidence review passed at c3a38b9. Documentation only; model measurements are bound to their own tested sources and retained artifacts. References #820.",
